        </div>

        <div class="about-content">
          <h2>Hands-on, always.</h2>
          <p>
            I learn best by building things that have to work: a PCB that talks over
            CAN, a controller that runs in real time on an embedded board, a model that
            holds up on data it has never seen.
          </p>
          <p>
            Away from the screen I run, listen to far too much music, and get involved
            in student life: the Xplore rover team, TEDx Ecublens, ESN EPFL and TUNES.
            Five languages so far, with German still a work in progress.
          </p>
          <div class="about-languages">
